VALUES ('913de3be-b110-4ff9-b63d-a2d8b8e78919', 'BA2.06', 2, 'numeric', 'Organized lists', 'Jo has a 1-cent coin, a 5-cent coin and a 10-cent coin. Jo picks one or more of the coins. How many different totals can Jo make?', '[]', '7', '7', 'The totals are 1, 5, 10 (one coin), 1+5 = 6, 1+10 = 11, 5+10 = 15 (two coins), and 1+5+10 = 16 (all three). That is 7 different totals.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"7","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"1, 5, 10, 6, 11, 15, 16: 7 totals, all different.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:31:31.193Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
