VALUES ('4236fbbe-2e20-4ce4-98cd-79468a5f0a11', 'BA2.09', 2, 'numeric', 'Odd and even patterns', 'Dee starts at 38 and adds 2 each time. She says 38, 40, 42, ... What is the 7th number she says?', '[]', '50', '38+2*6', 'The 7th number is 6 steps after the first. 6 steps of 2 is 12, and 38 + 12 = 50.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"50","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"38 + 6 x 2 = 50.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:26:38.753Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
