VALUES ('59403c14-9c46-47b4-833f-92b7a6ade8d1', 'BA3.03', 3, 'choice', 'Perimeter of polygons from side lengths', 'A square with sides of 8 centimeters has a triangle with three sides of 8 centimeters stuck onto one of its sides, so that two shapes share that side. What is the perimeter of the combined shape, in centimeters?', '["40","56","32","48"]', '40', '3*8+2*8', 'The shared side is inside the shape and is not part of the outside edge. The square leaves 3 sides of 8 = 24, and the triangle adds 2 sides of 8 = 16. Total: 24 + 16 = 40 centimeters.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"40","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Shared side is inside: square contributes 3 sides, triangle 2 sides: 5 x 8 = 40.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:25:25.476Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
