VALUES ('8cfb88d3-b5d2-4733-90f2-4ed451e1aafd', 'BA4.06', 2, 'choice', 'Deciding what must be true', 'If a number is a multiple of 6, then it is even. Zed''s number is odd. Which statement must be true?', '["Zed''s number is a multiple of 3","Zed''s number is a multiple of 5","Zed''s number is less than 6","Zed''s number is not a multiple of 6"]', 'Zed''s number is not a multiple of 6', NULL, 'A multiple of 6 would have to be even. Zed''s number is odd, so it cannot be a multiple of 6. Nothing else is certain.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"Zed''s number is not a multiple of 6","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Multiples of 6 are even; odd means not a multiple of 6.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:32:17.321Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
