VALUES ('2a74cd9b-d0f2-4842-b81f-23e01ed93412', 'BA4.09', 3, 'numeric', 'Distance between integers', 'Two numbers are opposites, and they are 12 apart. What is the greater of the two numbers?', '[]', '6', '12/2', 'Opposites are the same distance from 0, so each is half of 12 away from 0: 6. The numbers are -6 and 6, and the greater is 6.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"6","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Opposites 6 and -6 are 12 apart; greater is 6.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:30:24.816Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
