VALUES ('3826d186-24c1-4630-afbf-8d53f3286adf', 'BA5.01', 2, 'choice', 'Faces, edges and vertices of solids', 'A box is 2 cm by 3 cm by 4 cm, and its top face is 3 cm by 4 cm. How many faces of the box, including the top itself, are exactly the same size as the top face?', '["1","4","2","6"]', '2', '2', 'The bottom is the same size as the top. The other four faces measure 2 by 3 or 2 by 4, so they are different. The top and the bottom make 2 faces.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"2","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Faces come in pairs: 3x4 (top and bottom), 2x3, 2x4. Two faces are 3x4.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:36:23.597Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
