VALUES ('2806454c-3b5d-40e9-b192-f458bd93e221', 'BA5.06', 3, 'numeric', 'Dividing fractions', '? $\div \frac{3}{8} = \frac{4}{3}$. What is the ?', '[]', '1/2', '(4/3)*(3/8)', 'Dividing by $\frac{3}{8}$ gave $\frac{4}{3}$, so the ? is $\frac{4}{3}$ times $\frac{3}{8}$, which is $\frac{12}{24} = \frac{1}{2}$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"1/2","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"? = 4/3 x 3/8 = 1/2.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:35:32.506Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
