VALUES ('4f490ff0-412d-436b-9625-35027dee535b', 'BA5.06', 3, 'numeric', 'Fraction stories with several steps', 'A bottle holds $\frac{3}{4}$ liter. Mia drinks $\frac{2}{3}$ of the bottle. She then refills it to the top using a small cup that holds $\frac{1}{8}$ liter. How many cups of water does she pour in?', '[]', '4', '(2/3)*(3/4)/(1/8)', 'She drinks $\frac{2}{3} \times \frac{3}{4} = \frac{1}{2}$ liter. To refill it she needs $\frac{1}{2} \div \frac{1}{8} = 4$ cups.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"4","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Drinks 2/3 x 3/4 = 1/2 L; 1/2 / (1/8) = 4 cups.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:35:32.506Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
