VALUES ('27346c7d-9dbc-40ac-8913-03cd62face24', 'BA5.07', 3, 'numeric', 'Sum of a short arithmetic sequence', 'A sequence starts at 8 and goes up by 6 each time. It has 25 terms. What is the sum of all 25 terms?', '[]', '2000', '25*(8+152)/2', 'The last term is $8 + 24 \times 6 = 152$. The first and last add to 160. The sum is $25 \times 160 \div 2 = 2000$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"2000","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Last=8+24x6=152; 25x(8+152)/2=2000","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:34:00.664Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
