VALUES ('05a44cd9-a422-4e10-81de-2b84c4672109', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 1, 'choice', 'Two-step: multiply, then add more', 'There are 4 plates with 3 cookies on each plate. Dad puts 2 more cookies on the table. How many cookies are there in all?', '["12","9","14","20"]', '14', '4*3+2', 'The plates hold $4 \times 3 = 12$ cookies, and $12 + 2 = 14$. The choice 12 forgets the 2 extra cookies, 9 adds 4 + 3 + 2, and 20 multiplies 4 by (3 + 2).', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"14","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"4 x 3 = 12 cookies on plates; 12 + 2 = 14.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
