VALUES ('6c3ce424-3bbb-4de9-92da-396e9341b39b', 'NC26.3.ANR.6', 1, 'choice', 'Two-step: multiply, then take away', 'Ruth has 2 boxes with 8 markers in each box. She throws away 3 markers that are dried out. How many good markers does she have left?', '["19","13","5","10"]', '13', '2*8-3', 'The boxes hold $2 \times 8 = 16$ markers, and $16 - 3 = 13$. The choice 19 adds the 3, 5 uses only one box (8 - 3), and 10 adds 2 + 8.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"13","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"2 x 8 = 16 markers; 16 - 3 = 13.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:23:45.733Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
