VALUES ('37cf5bf7-bd44-4fd0-9e35-1959367f725d', 'NC26.3.SGMR.3', 1, 'choice', 'Area and perimeter together', 'Maya draws a rectangle that is 2 units wide and 3 units long. She counts 6 unit squares inside it, and the distance around it is 10 units. What is the area of the rectangle in square units?', '["6","10","5","12"]', '6', '2*3', 'Area is the number of unit squares inside the rectangle, which is 6. The 10 is the perimeter, the distance around.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"6","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Area = unit squares inside = 2 x 3 = 6. (10 is the perimeter.)","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:22:45.105Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
