VALUES ('3265f03a-26ab-42e3-89ff-e83d06157bdf', 'NC26.4.ANR.7', 2, 'numeric', 'Find a missing number or an error in a pattern', 'A pattern adds the same number each time: 7, ?, ?, 25. What is the number just before 25?', '[]', '19', '25-(25-7)/3', 'From 7 to 25 is 18 in three steps, so each step adds 6. The pattern is 7, 13, 19, 25. The number before 25 is 19.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"19","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Three equal steps from 7 to 25: 18/3 = 6. 7, 13, 19, 25. Just before 25 is 19.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:20:19.061Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
