VALUES ('5edacb57-5851-494a-952c-b15034dd90b8', 'NC26.4.ANR.7', 3, 'numeric', 'Repeating pattern: find the item at a position', 'A pattern of letters repeats M A T H M A T H M A T H ... In which place is the 6th letter T?', '[]', '23', '3+4*5', 'T is the 3rd letter in each group of 4. The Ts are in places 3, 7, 11, 15, 19 and 23. The 6th T is in place 23.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"23","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"T is at places 3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23. 6th T at 23.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:20:19.061Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
