VALUES ('61d4f509-80d3-4c7d-b5ea-5e40f6e93f14', 'NC26.4.SGMR.2', 2, 'numeric', 'Classify a triangle by its angles', 'Five triangles have these angle measures. A: 30, 60, 90. B: 50, 60, 70. C: 20, 30, 130. D: 45, 45, 90. E: 80, 40, 60. How many of the triangles are acute?', '[]', '2', NULL, 'A triangle is acute when all three angles are less than 90 degrees. B (50, 60, 70) and E (80, 40, 60) are acute. A and D have a right angle, and C has an obtuse angle. So 2 are acute.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"2","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"A right, B acute (all <90), C obtuse (130), D right, E acute. Acute: B, E = 2.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T19:22:54.972Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
