VALUES ('8faf3c1d-f4e3-492a-8d53-d81e1bda73fc', 'NC26.5.SGMR.2', 1, 'numeric', 'Ordered pairs from two number patterns', 'Pattern A starts at 0 and adds 1 each time. Pattern B starts at 0 and adds 7 each time. Matching numbers make the ordered pairs (A, B). What is the y-coordinate of the pair whose x-coordinate is 4?', '[]', '28', '4*7', 'Pattern A reaches 4 after 4 steps. Pattern B has added 7 four times, so it is 4 x 7 = 28. The pair is $(4, 28)$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"28","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"x = 4 is after 4 steps; B = 4 x 7 = 28.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:08:07.973Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
