VALUES ('5945ba5b-3c88-4987-8a8e-9c53a4df4e25', 'NC26.5.SGMR.2', 2, 'numeric', 'Ordered pairs from a real situation', 'A tank has 10 gallons of water at time 0, and 4 more gallons are added each minute. A point (minutes, gallons) is plotted for each minute. What is the x-coordinate of the point whose y-coordinate is 30?', '[]', '5', '(30-10)/4', 'The tank gained 30 - 10 = 20 gallons. At 4 gallons a minute, that takes 20 / 4 = 5 minutes. The point is $(5, 30)$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"5","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"10 + 4x = 30, 4x = 20, x = 5.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:08:07.973Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
