VALUES ('49dfe2ac-6031-41d9-a144-c3497cb4807e', 'NC26.5.RD.1', 2, 'numeric', 'Make a graph: scale, labels and plotting', 'The scale on a graph goes from 0 to 200 and counts by 20s. How many numbers are labeled on the scale, including 0 and 200?', '[]', '11', '200/20+1', 'The labels are 0, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 120, 140, 160, 180 and 200. There are $200 \div 20 = 10$ steps and one more label for 0, so $10 + 1 = 11$ labels.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"11","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"0, 20, 40, ..., 200: 200/20 = 10 steps, so 11 numbers.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:03:27.744Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
