VALUES ('8d356fdf-b6c6-478b-a056-86dfb9cab7de', 'NC26.6.ANR.4', 1, 'choice', 'Checking reasonableness', 'Without finding the exact answer, what can you tell about the sign of $-9 + 4$?', '["It is negative, because $-9$ is farther from 0 than 4 is.","It is positive, because 4 is positive.","It is zero, because the signs are different.","It is positive, because 9 is greater than 4."]', 'It is negative, because $-9$ is farther from 0 than 4 is.', NULL, 'The negative number has the greater distance from 0, so it wins and the sum is negative. Exactly, $-9 + 4 = -5$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"It is negative, because $-9$ is farther from 0 than 4 is.","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"-9 + 4: the addend with the larger absolute value is -9, so the sum is negative (-5). Only the third option gives the right sign with the right reason.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:20:36.614Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
