VALUES ('dbd44839-a401-49a5-806f-973d12a8e548', 'NC26.6.SGMR.2', 1, 'choice', 'Naming the quadrant or axis of a point', 'In which quadrant is the point $(4, -6)$? Quadrant I is where both coordinates are positive, and the quadrants are numbered I, II, III, IV going counterclockwise from there.', '["Quadrant IV","Quadrant I","Quadrant II","Quadrant III"]', 'Quadrant IV', NULL, 'The x-coordinate 4 is positive and the y-coordinate $-6$ is negative. Positive x with negative y is Quadrant IV.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"Quadrant IV","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"x = 4 > 0, y = -6 < 0: right and below, Quadrant IV.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:19:32.493Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
