VALUES ('62c72ce5-5045-439d-8e78-68343500e693', 'NC26.6.SGMR.2', 1, 'numeric', 'Reflections across both axes and what they preserve', 'The point $(3, 2)$ is reflected across the x-axis, and the new point is then reflected across the y-axis. What is the x-coordinate of the final point?', '[]', '-3', '0-3', 'Across the x-axis: $(3, 2)$ becomes $(3, -2)$. Across the y-axis: $(3, -2)$ becomes $(-3, -2)$. The final x-coordinate is $-3$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"-3","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"(3,2) -> (3,-2) -> (-3,-2). x = -3.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T20:19:32.493Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
