VALUES ('48193b7f-0759-40e1-a647-271d7644de15', 'NC26.M1.ANFR.3', 1, 'choice', 'Find the range of a function', 'A function has these input-output pairs: $(1, 4)$, $(2, 7)$ and $(3, 10)$. What is the range of the function?', '["$\\{4, 7, 10\\}$","$\\{1, 2, 3\\}$","$\\{1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 10\\}$","All real numbers"]', '$\{4, 7, 10\}$', NULL, 'The range is the set of outputs, the second numbers of the pairs: 4, 7 and 10. The set $\{1, 2, 3\}$ is the domain.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"$\\{4, 7, 10\\}$","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Range = set of outputs = {4, 7, 10}.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-18T01:07:02.801Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
