VALUES ('8e8bdfd9-b9da-49bb-a192-063042aebfac', 'NC26.M1.SDSR.1', 1, 'choice', 'Row and column totals of a two-way table', 'A school asked how students travel. In grade 9, 25 ride the bus and 15 walk. In grade 10, 20 ride the bus and 40 walk. How many students are in grade 10?', '["45","60","40","100"]', '60', '20+40', 'Grade 10 is the bus riders plus the walkers: $20 + 40 = 60$. (45 is all bus riders, 40 is the grade 10 walkers, 100 is everyone.)', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"60","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Grade 10: 20 bus + 40 walk = 60.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-18T03:37:30.634Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
