VALUES ('1f0fb392-3c69-4fad-b589-62b35b0e8244', 'PRE.08', 3, 'choice', 'Percent of a number', 'A mixture of 8 liters is 25% acid and the rest is water. How many liters of water must be added so that the mixture is 20% acid?', '["2","1.6","4","8"]', '2', '8*0.25/0.2-8', 'The acid is 25% of 8, which is 2 liters, and it stays 2 liters. For 2 liters to be 20%, the whole mixture must be $2\div 0.2=10$ liters. So add $10-8=2$ liters of water.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"2","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"acid 2 L; 2/0.2=10 L total; add 2 L water","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:39:00.653Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
