VALUES ('60f42632-3577-4f4e-b70f-c8985b7d7685', 'PRE.10', 2, 'numeric', 'Parallel lines and a transversal', 'A transversal cuts two parallel lines and makes 8 angles. One of the angles is $55^\circ$. How many of the 8 angles measure $55^\circ$?', '[]', '4', '4', 'The 55-degree angle has three partners equal to it: its vertical angle, and the two matching angles at the other line. That makes 4 angles of 55 degrees. The other 4 angles measure 125 degrees.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"4","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Four angles equal 55 (two at each intersection), the other four are 125. Answer 4.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:39:11.436Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
