VALUES ('b9bbaedd-5f3f-4072-8f67-6486ba61e046', 'PRE.13', 2, 'choice', 'Mode of a list', 'Which of these lists has more than one mode?', '["$1, 4, 4, 4, 6, 6$","$3, 3, 3, 8, 9$","$5, 6, 6, 7, 8, 9$","$2, 2, 5, 7, 7, 9$"]', '$2, 2, 5, 7, 7, 9$', NULL, 'In $2,2,5,7,7,9$ both 2 and 7 appear twice, so there are two modes. In the others, 4 appears most (three times), 3 appears most, and 6 appears most: one mode each.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"$2, 2, 5, 7, 7, 9$","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"A: 2 and 7 each twice -> two modes. B: 3. C: 4 (three times). D: 6. A.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:41:52.956Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
