VALUES ('a4cb505a-27d6-43bf-a364-25467276e0a7', 'PRE.14', 2, 'choice', 'Arranging with a condition', 'Mei makes 4-digit numbers by putting the cards 1, 2, 3 and 4 in a row, using every card once. How many of the numbers she can make are even?', '["$12$","$24$","$6$","$8$"]', '$12$', '2*3*2*1', 'The last digit must be 2 or 4: 2 choices. The other 3 digits can then be arranged in $3\times2\times1=6$ ways. $2\times6=12$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"$12$","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Last digit 2 or 4: 2 choices; other three cards 3!=6; 12.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-19T01:41:52.993Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
